  "title": {
   "en": "Tsukareta Ouji-sama to Kyouikugakari no Goreijou no Hanashi"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "疲れた王子様と教育係のご令嬢の話"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Tale of a Burned-Out Prince Who Made a Princess His Private Tutor"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Steven, the first prince of the Kingdom of Fierte, used to be called the perfect prince, but now he just spends his days drinking alone in his remote palace from noon onwards in a lethargic mood. One day, a woman of his age named Ada, the daughter of the Duchess of Raffine, suddenly arrives at his doorstep. At first, Steven was not pleased with her, but gradually he begins to open up to her. In the midst of his life, Stephen begins to remember memories of his childhood with Ada...?",
   "ja": "ラフィネ公爵家令嬢・エイダが国王から任命されたのは、完璧と名高いフィエルテ王国の第一王子・スティーブンの教育係だった。しかし、お目にかかったのは仕事に疲れ、ただただ無気力でだらしないの王子の姿。幼い頃から完璧を求められ、仕事をしすぎた王子様に「息抜き」の仕方を教えるべく\"教育\"をすることに…！疲れた王子様を教育係のご令嬢が癒す。"
  },
